<title>ITALY: TENNIS-SPAIN'S MANTILLA WINS BOLOGNA INTERNATIONAL TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SPAIN'S MANTILLA WINS BOLOGNA INTERNATIONAL TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>BOLOGNA, Italy 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the final of the $328,000 Bologna international men's clay-court tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix denotes seed):</p>
<p>2-Felix Mantilla (Spain) beat 8-Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) 4-6 6-2 6-1.</p>
</text>
